          "body": "A trio of English centres have caught the eye during the latest round of club action, sending what analysts describe as 'necessary signals' to Steve Borthwick. Max Ojomoh, Joe Marchant and Will Joseph each produced standout performances across the weekend, with Marchant’s defensive work in particular earning praise for his 20-tackle effort. While these displays offer the England head coach tactical options in the midfield, recent injury concerns across the professional game continue to dent the depth available for the upcoming autumn campaign."
