          "heading": "Victor Wembanyama trains with French club Provence Rugby during his off-season",
          "body": "French club Provence Rugby hosted NBA superstar Victor Wembanyama for training during his summer off-season. The 22-year-old French basketballer, standing at 7ft 4in, spent time working on physical and mental strength with the second-tier side, participating in passing drills, tackle pad work and line-outs. Wembanyama, who also shared a dressing-room embrace with former England international Teimana Harrison, praised the side's camaraderie, calling it a 'great experience' and stating, 'I want to do it again.'"
