          "body": "Italy sit eleventh in the Nations Championship standings after suffering three straight losses in their opening tournament fixtures. Gonzalo Quesada's men have struggled to find their rhythm, scoring 37 points across those three matches. Defensively, they have conceded 131 points in that same three-game span, a run that culminated in a 10-57 defeat against Australia in their last outing. Historically, the side reached their highest ever world ranking of No. 8 in both 2007 and 2024."
