          "body": "Exeter Chiefs director of rugby Rob Baxter has confirmed Wallabies forward Tom Hooper has returned to England and could feature in Sunday's Premiership match against Newcastle. The 25-year-old was released from the Australia squad ahead of the Bledisloe Cup series because the Tests fall outside World Rugby's regulation nine window. Hooper, who made 23 appearances for Exeter last season, has had a 10-day break and is eager to play, with Baxter noting that if they select him, \"it'll be a bench situation.\""
